OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FA fellow news anchor and friend of
OL,8,FDermot Murnaghan has said his death
OL,9,Fhit him "like a ton of bricks", having
OL,10,Fseen the presenter upbeat just months
OL,11,Fprior.
OL,13,FVeteran broadcaster Murnaghan died
OL,14,Faged 68 on July 11 following a period
OL,15,Fof illness with prostate cancer,
OL,16,Fhaving first announced his stage four
OL,17,Fdiagnosis in 2025.
OL,26,@qD@IOUqD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
