FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FThe former Eggheads quiz show host was
OL,8,Fbest known for his 15-year tenure as a
OL,9,Flead anchor on Sky News, and he
OL,10,Fpresented news bulletins for the BBC,
OL,11,FITV and Channel 4 during his decades-
OL,12,Flong career.
OL,14,FBroadcaster Matt Barbet told the Press
OL,15,FAssociation that avid cyclist
OL,16,FMurnaghan arrived with his bike at
OL,17,Ftheir last meeting, seeming well and
OL,18,Fupbeat.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FThe Sky News presenter, 50, is joining
OL,8,FSir Chris Hoy's Tour de 4 charity ride
OL,9,Fin Murnaghan's memory, having hoped
OL,10,Fthat they would complete it together.
OL,12,FThere were two things Murnaghan had
OL,13,Frecently encouraged him to do: the
OL,14,FGlasgow charity ride and a PSA
OL,15,F(prostate-specific antigen) test,
OL,16,Fhaving been "really cross" with
OL,17,Fhimself for not taking it.
OL,26,@xD@MOUxD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FLast month, shortly after receiving a
OL,8,Fnegative PSA result, Barbet texted
OL,9,FMurnaghan: "I've got a place on the
OL,10,Fride, really looking forward to it.
OL,11,FHope you're well, just checking in."
OL,13,FBarbet said: "He replied 'not so well
OL,14,Fmate, tbh. I'll keep you posted' and
OL,15,Fthat was the last I heard.
OL,17,F"It was really sad to hear. I was
OL,18,Fhoping he would come back with 'that's
OL,19,Ffantastic, mate. I'm doing it too.
OL,20,FCan't wait to see you on the start
OL,21,Fline'."
OL,26,@qD@LOUsD@dO]uD@NOUyD@AOU}D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
