PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FThe two journalists spent years
OL,8,Fcycling long distances on Sundays.
OL,9,FBarbet said of the 90km charity ride:
OL,10,F"Physically (I) should be able to
OL,11,Fmanage it. Emotionally I have no idea
OL,12,Fhow it's going to go."
OL,14,FHe was 21 when he watched Murnaghan
OL,15,Fcovering the death of Diana, Princess
OL,16,Fof Wales, something he "vividly"
OL,17,Fremembers and added to his admiration
OL,18,Fof him.
OL,26,@rD@AOUtD@VO]xD@XOUxD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FThey met in the early 2010s as Sky
OL,8,FNews colleagues when there was a
OL,9,F"cycling-focused" atmosphere at the
OL,10,Fchannel, given the formation of the
OL,11,FBritish professional cycling crew Team
OL,12,FSky.
OL,14,FMurnaghan presented Sky News while
OL,15,FBarbet did Channel 5.
OL,17,FBoth were already keen on the sport
OL,18,Fbut they were brought together by
OL,19,Fmutual cycling friends outside of
OL,20,Fjournalism.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FTheir group would get the bikes out on
OL,8,FSundays, completing 100km rides from
OL,9,Fnorth London to the Surrey Hills,
OL,10,FEssex or Hertfordshire.
OL,12,FNon-journalists in the crew saw
OL,13,FMurnaghan as Ron Burgundy and Mr
OL,14,FBarbet as Brian Fantana ` the leads in
OL,15,Fthe newsroom satire Anchorman, he said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FTheir friendship formed outside of
OL,8,Fjournalism ` it was unlikely they
OL,9,Fwould present together and "we were
OL,10,Fprobably a little bit competitive with
OL,11,Feach other, but in a friendly way", he
OL,12,Fadded.
OL,14,FBarbet laughed: "He was smart enough
OL,15,Fto see good people coming up behind
OL,16,Fhim ` I say that tongue and cheek."
OL,18,FCycling can encourage candour by
OL,19,Friding next to someone while not
OL,20,Flooking them in the eye, Barbet said.
OL,26,@qD@\OUsD@bO]vD@QOUxD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
