PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FSometimes "you're breathing heavily
OL,8,Fand trying to climb up a hill" but
OL,9,Fotherwise you spoke "about everything
OL,10,Funder the sun".
OL,12,FHe said: "So there'll be a little bit
OL,13,Fof work chat, and he would give me
OL,14,Fadvice because, you know, Dermot was
OL,15,F18 years older than me."
OL,26,@oD@KOUpD@^O]qD@UOUrD@NO]tD@JOUwD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
