OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FReminiscing on his Sky series Economic
OL,8,FCycle ` where he biked around the UK
OL,9,Finterviewing people ` Barbet said: "I
OL,10,Fknow full well it was a good story to
OL,11,Ftell about the the economy, but he
OL,12,Fdefinitely did it so he could go on
OL,13,Fhis bike."
OL,15,FMurnaghan completed last year's Tour
OL,16,Fde 4 alongside former track cyclist
OL,17,FSir Chris, also diagnosed with stage
OL,18,Ffour prostate cancer.
OL,26,@qD@dOUuD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,FReflecting on receiving the news from
OL,8,FMurnaghan's agent, Barbet added: "It
OL,9,Fwas a real shock, it was a genuine
OL,10,Fshock when I heard he died because it
OL,11,Fwas only three weeks since he was
OL,12,Fsaying I'll keep you posted.
OL,14,F"The last time I saw him, which was a
OL,15,Ffew months before, he was hugely
OL,16,Fupbeat, and of course he turned up on
OL,17,Fthe bike.
OL,26,@pD@bOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30212
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785212281
OL,3,CDermot Murnaghan's death hit friend
OL,4,Cand fellow broadcaster 'like ton of
OL,5,Cbricks'
OL,7,F"He loved being on the bike, he turned
OL,8,Fup on the bike, we had a coffee
OL,9,Foutside ` he was looking well, he had
OL,10,Fcolour in his cheeks.
OL,12,F"He always kept himself in good nick
OL,13,Fand he was trim... A handsome guy.
OL,15,F"So I was really optimistic for him at
OL,16,Fthat point, so when when the news
OL,17,Fcame... (it) floored me, like a ton of
OL,18,Fbricks, that he's gone."
OL,20,FBarbet has raised #2,808 out of his
OL,21,F#3,000 target for Prostate Cancer UK.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@AOUzD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
