OL,7,FTour de 4 brings together people who
OL,8,Fhave been directly or indirectly
OL,9,Faffected by cancer and raises funds
OL,10,Ffor charities focused on the disease.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/13
